    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Set in the scenic countryside of Crossabeg, “Suncroft” is a delightful three-bedroom single-storey cottage offering a wonderful opportunity to create a character-filled home in a peaceful rural setting.Extending to approximately 79 sq.m., the accommodation is both cosy and functional, comprising an inviting hallway, a comfortable living room with an open fire, a kitchen/dining area, utility room, three bedrooms, and a wet room. While the property is well maintained, it presents excellent potential for modernisation and reimagining to suit contemporary living.\r\nThe cottage sits on an attractive site of approximately 0.17 hectares (0.42 acres). To the rear, a sunny south-facing garden, mainly laid in lawn, offers ideal outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining. The front of the property showcases beautifully maintained \u001dower beds and colourful shrubbery, re\u001decting careful attention to detail. Despite its tranquil setting, Suncroft is conveniently located just minutes from Wexford Town (approx. 10 km), providing easy access to a wide range of amenities including shops, schools, restaurants, hotels, and the renowned National Opera House. The property is also well connected via the N11/M11 and N25, with Dublin City and airport approximately 1.5 hours away. Nearby villages such as Crossabeg, Oylegate and Castlebridge offer everyday essentials, while some of Wexford’s finest beaches—including Curracloe, Ballinesker, and Morriscastle—are within easy reach. Nature lovers will appreciate the close proximity to Raven Forest and Curracloe Beach, as well as Eden Vale, a magical woodland setting perfect for scenic walks. Combining countryside charm with excellent accessibility, Suncroft represents a rare opportunity to acquire a home full of character in one of Wexford’s most desirable locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall- (5m x 1m), Timber flooring.\r\nLiving room - (4.6m x 3.3m), Laminate timber flooring, electric fire fitted in feature fireplace.\r\nKitchen/ Diner - (3.8m x 3.6m), Lino flooring, cabinets at waist and eye level, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, solid fuel stove, HP.\r\nUtility Room - (2.4m x 1.2m), Lino flooring, storage.\r\nWet Room - (2.5m x 1.8m), Fully tiled, WC, WHB, Triton T80z.\r\nBedroom 1 - (4.5m x 3.3m), Carpet flooring.\r\nBedroom 2 - (3.3m x 2.4m), Laminate timber flooring.\r\nBedroom 3 - (3.4m x 2.4m), Laminate timber flooring, fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nOutside: Mature gardens, driveway with ample parking.\r\nServices: Mains water, private sewerage, Oil fired central heating\r\nBER: G Ber No: 119231405 Performance indicator: 558.5 kWh/m2/yr"
      },
